🧠 Pronoun – Important Questions for SSC CGL

📘 Basic MCQs (With Explanation)

1. Which of the following is a pronoun?
a) Boy
b) He
c) Book
d) Run
✅ उत्तर: b) He


2. ___ is my best friend.
a) He
b) His
c) Him
d) Hers
✅ उत्तर: a) He


3. This pen belongs to Riya. It is ___.
a) her
b) hers
c) she
d) him
✅ उत्तर: b) hers


4. Ravi and ___ are going to the market.
a) me
b) mine
c) I
d) myself
✅ उत्तर: c) I


5. Which of these is a reflexive pronoun?
a) Them
b) Myself
c) Their
d) Him
✅ उत्तर: b) Myself


6. She saw ___ in the mirror.
a) herself
b) her
c) hers
d) she
✅ उत्तर: a) herself


7. Each of the boys has ___ own book.
a) their
b) his
c) her
d) theirs
✅ उत्तर: b) his


8. That house is ___.
a) mine
b) me
c) myself
d) I
✅ उत्तर: a) mine


9. Which one is a demonstrative pronoun?
a) His
b) This
c) My
d) Me
✅ उत्तर: b) This


10. Nobody helped me, so I did it ___.
a) my
b) me
c) myself
d) mine
✅ उत्तर: c) myself




---

🔟 Quick One-Liner MCQs

11. ___ are playing football. → ✅ They


12. Is this pen ___? → ✅ yours


13. Reema and ___ went to the mall. → ✅ I


14. He introduced ___ to the manager. → ✅ himself


15. ___ is knocking at the door? → ✅ Who




---

📚 Types-Based Questions

16. ‘This’, ‘That’, ‘These’, ‘Those’ किस प्रकार के pronoun हैं?
✅ Demonstrative Pronoun


17. ‘Myself’, ‘Himself’, ‘Yourself’ क्या हैं?
✅ Reflexive Pronoun


18. ‘Who’, ‘Whose’, ‘Whom’, ‘Which’ क्या हैं?
✅ Interrogative Pronoun


19. ‘Each’, ‘Either’, ‘Neither’, ‘Everyone’ क्या हैं?
✅ Indefinite Pronoun


20. ‘I’, ‘We’, ‘You’, ‘He’, ‘She’ किस प्रकार के Pronoun हैं?
✅ Personal Pronoun




---

✍️ Fill in the Blanks

21. She blamed ___ for the mistake. → ✅ herself


22. I looked at ___ in the mirror. → ✅ myself


23. These are not your shoes; they are ___. → ✅ mine


24. ___ of the two is better? → ✅ Which


25. Ram is my friend. ___ is very intelligent. → ✅ He




